{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1633046400, "end_date": 1633651199, "month_true_total": 224, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:00:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "100700013", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990430805", "personaname": "sean0099", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sean0099/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1831, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1233, "last_played": 1726513351, "avatar": "523bed88e7ebbe542a5e007f74e5a865a0dc756c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game! Still even after all these years\n", "timestamp_created": 1633650316, "timestamp_updated": 1633650316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100694814", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010315744", "personaname": "limelight1210", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/limelight1210/", "num_games_owned": 1525, "num_reviews": 845, "playtime_forever": 521, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 450, "last_played": 1633738820, "avatar": "14d4b5425947b3781b2ad861fda6fb1a02a18cf9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I know nothing about the Warhammer universe. Ive only played Chaosbane and it was a good hack n slash. \n\nThis game is for fans of Gears of War (minus the stick-to-cover mechanic and awful Roadie Cam), and third person action shooters in general. And its AWESOME. Killing hundreds, maybe even thousands of Orcs feels fantastic, with execution moves even more satisfying. Awesome weapons and theres ammo everywhere!!! I really liked the voice actors as well- they dont act like gritty hardcore meatheads like in GoW. Like I mentioned earlier, I know nothing about the Warhammer storyline, but this game gave me just enough so I know whats going on. \n\nTheres no campaign co-op which is a bummer, but there IS a horde mode which is a LOT of fun. \n\nSega needs to make a sequel to this game!!!", "timestamp_created": 1633640681, "timestamp_updated": 1633640681, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494381994009017944", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100694597", "author": {"steamid": "76561199144696779", "personaname": "the real walter white", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199144696779/", "num_games_owned": 208, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 522, "last_played": 1672149866, "avatar": "162c07f2ad556413e0425e961384421a3995c583"}, "language": "english", "review": "basicaly genocide a bunch of greedy goblins", "timestamp_created": 1633640343, "timestamp_updated": 1633640343, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100694563", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056369359", "personaname": "Jaqz", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056369359/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 782, "last_played": 1707622277, "avatar": "e8ec73edb8f41679dfaa66b640ec9834417f31db"}, "language": "engli